    "excerpt": "The last week of July kicked off on a partly-to-mostly sunny and seasonably warm note across the Lower Susquehanna Valley with high temperatures in the mid-to-upper 80s Monday afternoon. Unfortunately, the tranquil conditions will be replaced by another round of severe thunderstorms and flash flooding concerns this afternoon and evening. …",
